    count: 3 [observed], each processed independently
    native_color: one dominant non-bg color per row; chosen as most frequent non-bg color, ties broken by leftmost first occurrence
    native_colors_per_example: 3 distinct colors, always {YELLOW, MAGENTA, AZURE} [observed]; any 3 distinct non-bg colors should work
    native_pixel_fraction: 30-70% of row width
